# RRDA Data

This repository contains datasets used in the article:  
**“Ridge Redundancy Analysis for High-Dimensional Omics Data” (2025)**  
https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.04.16.649138

## Data availability

The following datasets are included in this repository:

- **Soybean data**
  - `SoyData.RDS`
  - `soymet.csv`
  - `soymicro.csv`

- **Breast cancer data**
  - `breast.RDS`

## Methylation data

The methylation dataset is too large to be hosted on GitHub.  
Please refer to the script `rrda_script/Meth.rmd` for instructions on downloading and preprocessing the data.

To install the required annotation package:

```r
# if (!requireNamespace("BiocManager", quietly = TRUE))
#     install.packages("BiocManager")

# BiocManager::install("IlluminaHumanMethylation450kanno.ilmn12.hg19")

library(IlluminaHumanMethylation450kanno.ilmn12.hg19)
```

## Alternative access (breast cancer data)

The breast cancer methylation and gene expression data are also available via the **brgedata** package (Pelegri-Siso et al. 2024):

```r
library(brgedata)

data(brge_methy)
brge_methy

data(brge_gexp)
brge_gexp
```

